# TVsham website: response headers for Netlify and Cloudflare Pages, which read this file from the
# published folder and do not serve it. Apache: see .htaccess. nginx: see deploy/nginx.conf. The
# policy is also in index.html as a <meta> tag, for a host that sends no headers of its own.
# The same values are in all of these, and src/website.test.ts fails when they differ.
#
# TVSHAM_SERVER_ORIGIN is filled in by scripts/build-web.mjs with the origin of the recognition
# server the site is built for (TVSHAM_SERVER_URL). Left unfilled it is not a valid source, so the
# browser ignores it and the site can reach nothing at all.
#
# The policy was measured, not copied: e2e/web.mjs drives the site with these headers on every
# response, against a real server, and fails on any violation. What each source is for:
#   script-src 'self'        the bundle and guard.js; nothing inline, no eval
#   style-src 'self'         site.css
#     'sha256-47DEQ…'        react-native-web adds its stylesheet as an empty <style> element and
#                            fills it through insertRule, which the policy does not govern; this is
#                            the hash of the empty string, so it admits that element and no inline
#                            style with anything in it ('unsafe-inline' would admit them all)
#   img-src 'self'           the favicon and expo-router's header icons
#     https://upload.wikimedia.org  Wikipedia thumbnails      } the pictures the server's
#     https://i.ytimg.com           YouTube thumbnails        } results point to (resolve.ts,
#     https://image.tmdb.org        TMDB posters, logos, cast } tmdb.ts), and no other host
#   media-src blob:          the picker reads a chosen video's length through a <video> on its
#                            blob: address
#   connect-src TVSHAM_SERVER_ORIGIN  the recognition server, and nothing else
#   require-trusted-types-for 'script'; trusted-types 'none'
#                            no string ever becomes HTML or script: React, react-native-web and
#                            Expo Router run without creating a single Trusted Types policy
# frame-ancestors 'none' and X-Frame-Options: DENY: the app is not meant to be embedded, so no other
# site can frame it and steer its buttons.
#
# Referrer-Policy: no-referrer, because a site like this is one household's front end to its own
# server, and its address is nothing the pages it links to need to learn.
# Permissions-Policy turns off every feature the browser would otherwise grant: in a browser the app
# records nothing (the camera tab says so), reads no sensor and plays nothing.
#
# Cache-Control: the bundle and the assets carry a content hash in their names, so a new build gets
# new names and they can be kept for a year. Everything else is revalidated on every load. A header
# two rules set is joined with a comma by both hosts, so every path gets Cache-Control from exactly
# one rule below; the browser suite checks that on every response.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'sha256-47DEQpj8HBSa+/TImW+5JCeuQeRkm5NMpJWZG3hSuFU='; img-src 'self' https://upload.wikimedia.org https://i.ytimg.com https://image.tmdb.org; media-src blob:; connect-src TVSHAM_SERVER_ORIGIN; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests; require-trusted-types-for 'script'; trusted-types 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), browsing-topics=(), camera=(), clipboard-read=(), clipboard-write=(), display-capture=(), encrypted-media=(), fullscreen=(), gamepad=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), hid=(), idle-detection=(), local-fonts=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), otp-credentials=(), payment=(), picture-in-picture=(), publickey-credentials-create=(), publickey-credentials-get=(), screen-wake-lock=(), serial=(), storage-access=(), usb=(), window-management=(), xr-spatial-tracking=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

/_expo/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/settings
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/library
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/result
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/404.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/site.css
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/guard.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/robots.txt
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/.well-known/security.txt
  Cache-Control: no-cache
